{"4228740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backcast", "steam_appid": 4228740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program drones using simple Python programming language and automate various investment tasks to get boring simple work done. Press &quot;Run&quot; and experience the satisfaction of watching drones complete all the hard work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike many programming games, this game is not structured around clearing level by level, but progresses continuously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you earn funds through tasks, you can use them to unlock the next technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming is done in simple Python language. The game is designed so that from the beginning, basic programming concepts that will be needed are introduced one by one, allowing you to learn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All relevant information is shown, but when solving various tasks in the game, explanations are not given one by one. You need to find solutions yourself. For people without programming experience, this may feel extremely challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have extensive programming experience, you can breeze through the early stages of the game and progress to more complex tasks. It should still be an interesting challenge for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/863d41998c4f2bc8ff46e7d4bd01cb9f.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/863d41998c4f2bc8ff46e7d4bd01cb9f.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/863d41998c4f2bc8ff46e7d4bd01cb9f.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/b02e608dca72df6b86a2c66674d461a6.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program drones using simple Python programming language and automate various investment tasks to get boring simple work done. Press &quot;Run&quot; and experience the satisfaction of watching drones complete all the hard work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike many programming games, this game is not structured around clearing level by level, but progresses continuously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/955637da7628b9090e13959e3da6b315.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you earn funds through tasks, you can use them to unlock the next technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/c26b5f7a6a242b30fc59fefc2cada3a1.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming is done in simple Python language. The game is designed so that from the beginning, basic programming concepts that will be needed are introduced one by one, allowing you to learn them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/69566098f13e5b8a3572df1f406b3fa7.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All relevant information is shown, but when solving various tasks in the game, explanations are not given one by one. You need to find solutions yourself. For people without programming experience, this may feel extremely challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.poster.avif?t=1772155828\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.webm?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228740/extras/404e9a01874c9cf01ee3fd4c9a834234.mp4?t=1772155828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have extensive programming experience, you can breeze through the early stages of the game and progress to more complex tasks. It should still be an interesting challenge for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://